{"id":"st2094-20","designation":"ST 2094-20","title":"Dynamic Metadata for Color Volume Transform — Application #2","state":"stabilized","suite":"2094","official":{"family_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/doc/st2094-20/","latest_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/latest/st2094-20/","checked_at":"2026-11-11"},"scope":"This standard specifies the content-dependent Color Volume Transform metadata set for Application #2, a specialized model of the color volume transform defined by the core components document SMPTE ST 2094-1. The Color Volume Transform is based on a tone mapping curve that operates on image data in a perceptually-uniform domain and a luminance-dependent saturation gain curve. Both the tone mapping curve and the saturation gain curve are fully characterized by a set of parameters.","outline":[],"definitions":[{"term":"Yu’v’ color space","definition":"color space with coordinates Y, u', v', where Y is the Y component of the CIE 1931 standard colorimetric"}],"keywords":[{"term":"Chromaticity","zh":"色度","abbr":"","category":"measurement","source":"curated"},{"term":"High Dynamic Range","zh":"高动态范围","abbr":"HDR","category":"hdr","source":"curated"},{"term":"Mastering","zh":"母版制作","abbr":"","category":"mastering","source":"curated"},{"term":"SMPTE ST 2094","zh":"动态元数据","abbr":"ST 2094","category":"hdr","source":"curated"},{"term":"Color Volume Transform","zh":"色彩体积变换","abbr":"CVT","category":"hdr","source":"curated"},{"term":"Mastering Display","zh":"母版显示器","abbr":"","category":"hdr","source":"curated"},{"term":"Wide Color Gamut","zh":"广色域","abbr":"WCG","category":"hdr","source":"curated"},{"term":"Tone Mapping","zh":"色调映射","abbr":"","category":"hdr","source":"curated"},{"term":"SMPTE ST 2086","zh":"母版显示元数据","abbr":"ST 2086","category":"hdr","source":"curated"},{"term":"IPR","zh":"","abbr":"IPR","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"CIE","zh":"","abbr":"CIE","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"SDR","zh":"","abbr":"SDR","category":"other","source":"a